<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Femsa cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Femsa cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analysts Scott Wilkin and Marco Vera on Wednesday downgraded their rating for Mexican bottler Coca Cola Femsa SA de CV to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The downgrade ... comes on the back of exceptional price performances, outperforming the market by 33 percent in 1996 and 12 percent over the past three months,&quot; they wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were off 5/8 to 30 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
